{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Hecke.LengthAdditive","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Hecke.LengthAdditive","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Hecke.PermLength"],"declarations":12,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.Inversions.length_mul_eq_add_iff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.Inversions.length_mul_eq_add_iff","kind":"theorem","line":188,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/LengthAdditive.lean#L188-L214","doc":"**Length is additive exactly when no inversion is undone.**\n\n`ℓ(u * v) = ℓ(u) + ℓ(v)` holds iff every pair inverted by `v` is still\ninverted by `u * v`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.Inversions.invCount_add_invCount","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.Inversions.invCount_add_invCount","kind":"theorem","line":148,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/LengthAdditive.lean#L148-L184","doc":"**The length-additivity defect.**  `ℓ(u) + ℓ(v)` exceeds `ℓ(u * v)` by twice\nthe number of `v`-inversions that `u` undoes. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.Inversions.invCount_eq_card_symmDiff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.Inversions.invCount_eq_card_symmDiff","kind":"theorem","line":121,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/LengthAdditive.lean#L121-L146","doc":"The inversion count of `u` counts the pairs inverted by exactly one of\n`v` and `u * v`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.Inversions.vPair_mem_invSet_iff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.Inversions.vPair_mem_invSet_iff","kind":"theorem","line":87,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/LengthAdditive.lean#L87-L117","doc":"**The key membership criterion.**  `u` inverts the sorted image of `p` under\n`v` exactly when precisely one of `v`, `u * v` inverts `p`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.Inversions.vPair_inv_vPair","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.Inversions.vPair_inv_vPair","kind":"theorem","line":79,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/LengthAdditive.lean#L79-L85","doc":"`vPair v` is undone by `vPair v⁻¹` on strictly ordered pairs. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.Inversions.vPair_mem_pairsLt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.Inversions.vPair_mem_pairsLt","kind":"theorem","line":70,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/LengthAdditive.lean#L70-L77","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.Inversions.vPair","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.Inversions.vPair","kind":"def","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/LengthAdditive.lean#L66-L68","doc":"The map induced on unordered pairs by a permutation: apply `v`, then re-sort. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.Inversions.sortPair","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.Inversions.sortPair","kind":"def","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/LengthAdditive.lean#L62-L64","doc":"Sort a pair into increasing order. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.Inversions.filter_mem_invSet","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.Inversions.filter_mem_invSet","kind":"theorem","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/LengthAdditive.lean#L53-L58","doc":"Filtering the ordered pairs by membership in an inversion set is a no-op. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.Inversions.invSet_subset_pairsLt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.Inversions.invSet_subset_pairsLt","kind":"theorem","line":50,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/LengthAdditive.lean#L50-L51","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.Inversions.mem_pairsLt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.Inversions.mem_pairsLt","kind":"theorem","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/LengthAdditive.lean#L47-L48","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.Inversions.pairsLt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.Inversions.pairsLt","kind":"def","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/LengthAdditive.lean#L43-L45","doc":"The pairs `(a, b)` with `a < b`: the index set every inversion set sits in. ","signatureChunk":0}]}